<title>UK: LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets $200 mln four-year bond.</title>
<headline>LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets $200 mln four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN Amro Hoare Govett and Bear Stearns.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK RHEINLAND-PFALZ</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.25 PCT  MATURITY    07.NOV.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.074   PAY DATE   L06.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.674    LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> SPREAD     +10 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   NO</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.40	PRAECIP     =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
